%% beamerthemejajposter.sty
%% Poster layout theme for beamer + beamerposter.
%%
%%   \usetheme[institution=uwmadison]{jajposter}
%%
%% Layout only. Colors come from beamercolorthemejaj (semantic names) and
%% the institution file jaj-inst-<institution>.def via jaj-branding.
%%
%% Derived from the Gemini theme by Anish Athalye
%% (https://github.com/anishathalye/gemini), MIT License:
